# The W state |001> + |010> + |100>, the textbook tensor whose rank and border
# rank differ: rank 3, border rank 2, because (|0>+t|1>)^3 - |000> divided by t
# tends to it as t -> 0. Nothing here can see a border rank; this fixture is
# the rank half, and the one the exact search can settle outright.
#
# Slice 0 is the z=0 face, carrying |010> at (0,1) and |100> at (1,0).
# Slice 1 is the z=1 face, carrying |001> at (0,0).
field 2
shape 2 2 2

0 1
1 0

1 0
0 0
